# 统一行尾：仓库里存 LF，检出时按平台转换
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确按二进制处理，避免任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.glb binary
*.sogdata binary
*.sog binary
*.res binary
*.pck binary

# Godot 文本资源
*.gd text
*.tscn text
*.tres text
*.godot text
*.cfg text
*.gdshader text
*.glsl text

# 避免 GitHub 把插件当第三方代码统计
addons/gdgs/** linguist-vendored
